WEBVTT

00:01:59.798 --> 00:02:01.468
as vice president?

00:02:01.492 --> 00:02:02.961
NOI: I'm delighted.

00:02:02.985 --> 00:02:06.412
It's important to the aspiration
of girls and women

00:02:06.436 --> 00:02:08.953
that they see role models
they can relate to.

00:02:09.381 --> 00:02:13.541
Vice President-elect Harris
is exactly that kind of role model,

00:02:13.565 --> 00:02:16.230
particularly for girls and women of color.

00:02:16.254 --> 00:02:18.215
And every woman who steps forward

00:02:18.239 --> 00:02:21.477
makes more space
for the women who come next.

00:02:22.479 --> 00:02:26.197
JG: Of course both of us know
from our own experiences

00:02:26.221 --> 00:02:28.033
that even when women get to the top,

00:02:28.057 --> 00:02:31.742
unfortunately, too much time
and attention will be spent